<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia January palm oil exports 586,046t-SGS.</title>
<headline>Malaysia January palm oil exports 586,046t-SGS.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cargo surveyor Societe Generale de Surveillance (SGS) Malaysia Sdn Bhd said it estimated Malaysia's palm oil exports for January at 586,046 tonnes against 717,197 in December.</p>
<p>It said the exports comprised 143,617 tonnes of RBD palm oil, 218,346 tonnes of RBD palm olein and 78,253 tonnes of RBD palm stearin. The other products were 145,830 tonnes.</p>
